; Text cursor: y (pixel row) and x (pixel column)
;
; Where #R$9E79 draws the next character; read as a word with L = y and H = x. +0 byte: y, pixel row 0-191, set by
; script codes $82 (y only) and $8E (y and x). +1 byte: x, pixel column 0-255; recomputed by #R$9F75 before each
; string from the alignment mode and the string width, and advanced by the width of every character drawn (#R$9F0A).
@label=TextCursorY
g$9F26 DEFB $00
@label=TextCursorX
 $9F27 DEFB $00
